<title>UK: TABLE-UK's Flextech reduces losses.</title>
<headline>TABLE-UK's Flextech reduces losses.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)  (loss)     1.28		  vs    6.59 (loss)</p>
<p> Operating loss *	  4.73		  vs    8.49</p>
<p> Turnover		   44.6		   vs   24.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Cable and satellite television company Flextech Plc said its operating profits did not take an exceptional charge of 3.5 million stg into account. The group's pre-tax losses stood at 1.65 million stg against 7.98 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
